From: Surojit012 <surojitguha58648@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Jan 2026 00:04:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Transform to crypto Twitter engagement tool with personas,
 variants, and quote tweets

- Add crypto context detection (partnership, technical, hot take, etc.)
- Implement 6 crypto personas (Builder, Trader, Researcher, Degen, Founder, Community)
- Add 3 engagement modes (Neutral, Engagement Max, Signal Only)
- Create reply variants system (Safe, Bold, Alpha)
- Add quote tweet generator with hooks and supporting lines
- Implement session memory for user preferences
- Update UI with crypto-native design and terminology
- Enhance Chrome extension with all crypto features
- Add comprehensive crypto context awareness to AI prompts
- Update branding to 'Crypto Twitter Engagement Tool'
- Maintain mobile-first responsive design
- Add new API endpoints for quote generation and variants
